  "mechanism": "Full root changes both executable verifier path and its domain assumption: General.oracleVerifier sequentially composes SingleRound.oracleVerifier, which liftContext-wraps Simple.oracleVerifier. Before Simple queries the input polynomial for the next target; after it queries the sent Message. The root also gains IsDomain R.",
  "review_gaps": "Actual-parent/repair route statically checked: General.lean:223-230 soundness root and :161-168 oracleVerifier; SingleRound.lean:806-810 liftContext; :423-438 Simple.oracleVerifier (line positions at parent). F5 degree-zero/domain{0}/input0/target1/message1 is the upstream execution witness: sum guard passes; old target0 makes output claim true, new target1 leaves it false. IsDomain does not absorb it because F5 is a field. Regression tests cover actual Simple direct/oracle execution; complete full-root rbrKnowledgeSoundness contract witness has not been mechanically lifted or locally compiled. Existing admits preserved.",
